#: ../../index.rst:7
msgid ""
"Krita is a sketching and painting program designed for digital artists. Our "
"vision for Development of Krita is —"
msgstr ""
"Krita ye un programa de dibuxu y pintura diseñáu p'artistes dixitales. La "
"nuesa visión del desendolcu de Krita ye:"

#: ../../index.rst:9
msgid ""
"Krita is a free and open source cross-platform application that offers an "
"end-to-end solution for creating digital art files from scratch. Krita is "
"optimized for frequent, prolonged and focused use. Explicitly supported "
"fields of painting are illustrations, concept art, matte painting, textures, "
"comics and animations. Developed together with users, Krita is an "
"application that supports their actual needs and workflow. Krita supports "
"open standards and interoperates with other applications."
msgstr ""
"Krita ye una aplicación llibre y multiplataforma qu'ufre una solución "
"tresversal pa la creación de ficheros d'arte dixital dende cero, sofita "
"estándares abiertos, interopera con otres aplicaciones y ta optimizáu pa un "
"usu frecuente, prollongáu y enfocáu. Los campos de pintura sofitaos "
"esplícitamente son ilustraciones, arte conceutual, pintura mate, cómics y "
"animaciones. Krita, desendolcáu en conxuntu cola comunidá, ye l'aplicación "
"que s'adauta a les necesidaes y el fluxu de trabayu de to."

#: ../../index.rst:17
msgid ""
"Krita's tools are developed keeping the above vision in mind. Although it "
"has features that overlap with other raster editors its intended purpose is "
"to provide robust tool for digital painting and creating artworks from "
"scratch. As you learn about Krita, keep in mind that it is not intended as a "
"replacement for Photoshop. This means that the other programs may have more "
"features than Krita for image manipulation tasks, such as stitching together "
"photos, while Krita's tools are most relevant to digital painting, concept "
"art, illustration, and texturing. This fact accounts for a great deal of "
"Krita's design."
msgstr ""
"Les ferramientes de Krita desendólquense teniendo la visión d'enriba en "
"mente. Magar que tenga carauterístiques que se superponen a otros editores "
"de gráficos rasterizaos, el so propósitu ye apurrir una ferramienta robusta "
"pa la pintura y creación d'arte gráficu dixital dende cero. A midida que "
"vayas deprendiendo más, vas decatate que Krita nun ta pensáu como un troquéu "
"de Photoshop. Esto ye, otros programes puen tener más carauterístiques que "
"Krita pa les xeres de manipulación d'imáxenes como la xuntura de semeyes, "
"mentanto que les de Krita son más afayadices pa la pintura, arte conceutual, "
"ilustración y testures dixitales. Esti fechu desplica gran parte del diseñu "
"de Krita."

